    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NETWORK NODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect to a neon puzzle that will power your brain to its full potential!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating cyberspace world of Network Nodes \u2014 a minimalist yet infinitely deep puzzle game where each solution opens new possibilities. Connect glowing nodes, create perfect networks, and watch your creations come alive in dazzling neon light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662750/extras/ef842da24bdd968d754cbcf27bcd455e.avif?t=1751307724\" width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTUITIVE MECHANICS, BOTTOMLESS DEPTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Network Nodes, simple rules hide boundless complexity. Each node requires a specific number of connections \u2014 no more, no less. Draw lines between nodes, maintaining color compatibility and avoiding intersections. Elegant in its simplicity, yet requires mastery to perfect.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662750/extras/ef842da24bdd968d754cbcf27bcd455e.avif?t=1751307724\" width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Aesthetics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a hypnotizing cyberpunk world with pulsating nodes and glowing lines against the cosmic void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 40 Unique Puzzles:</strong> From tutorials to challenges that truly test your logical thinking abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> Gradually learn new mechanics \u2014 colored nodes, universal connections, dynamic activation, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Experience:</strong> No timers, no penalties \u2014 just you and the puzzle in a meditative flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Design:</strong> Clean and elegant interface where nothing distracts you from solving puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM NOVICE TO MASTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple connections and gradually discover complex concepts of network design. With each level, puzzles become more intricate, introducing new elements: obstacles, multi-colored nodes, cascade activation, and strategic routing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Network Nodes perfectly balances accessibility and complexity \u2014 each solution brings instant satisfaction, while each new level challenges your understanding.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the meditative world of logic puzzles and let your mind shine in Network Nodes today!</p>",
